# Optional: AI video avatar (Athene Alerts — same embed style as milancheeks.com).
# Paste your full stream URL from the Athene dashboard. Never commit secrets.
# VITE_ATHENE_STREAM_EMBED_URL=https://stream.athenealerts.ai/?api_key=YOUR_KEY&autostart=true&mic=on&microphone=true&audio=true&voice=true

# Optional: override FAB / demo portrait (defaults to bundled `src/assets/ai-avatar.png` — replace that file with your headshot, same filename).
# VITE_AI_AVATAR_IMAGE_URL=https://example.com/your-headshot.jpg
